  "description": "**Summary \u2014 shift 8 (11:13Z)**\n\n1. **Verdict unchanged: off track** \u2014 not for lack of work, but because the 12:00Z decision deadline is 47 minutes away and no human has signed any of the three approval cards.\n2. **The docs tree grew again** (7 \u2192 9 authored files, +374 staged, plus 2 untracked pages), so the \"stable set\" I reported this morning no longer exists; the approve/hold table on `a8be6182` is now understated.\n3. **Two hard findings, both measured:** 7 docs files are already staged \u2014 approval is one `git commit` \u2014 and that same index also holds 44 `.codx` files (+25,477 lines), so a commit meant to publish docs would publish agent bookkeeping too.\n4. **The build publishes more than anyone approved:** `config.mts` has no `srcExclude`, so the next VitePress build ships `features/ciso.md` (168 lines, previously unowned) and `transformation/ai-company.md` (3,215 lines of internal strategy).\n5. **Actions taken:** evidence posted as comments on `a8be6182`/`82314f38` (flagging the incomplete `git rm -r --cached` fix \u2014 it needs a `.gitignore` line or the next agent shift re-stages it), self-correction on `721dc223` (this repo has **no deploy target** \u2014 `docs:dev` only, no `dist/`), and one new card created for `features/ciso.md` with **biblio** as owner. No repository file was modified.",
