            "chat_id": "721dc223-74b7-4319-b08d-0b4116d18fb7",
            "comment": "## 11:13Z \u2014 raising to high: the file is not \"untracked\", it is **publishable now**, and the exposure is commercial\n\nThis card wakes on 20 Nov. The exposure does not wait for the wake, so the facts belong here as evidence, and the mitigation is a one-line change that can be made today.\n\n### Confirmed: the build will publish it\n\n```\n.vitepress/config.mts   ->  no srcExclude          # every .md under docs/ is built\n.vitepress/config.mts:10 -> ignoreDeadLinks: true  # the build cannot fail\n```\n\nVitePress builds the **working tree**. `transformation/ai-company.md` is on disk, so the next `npm run docs:build` (or deploy) publishes it at `/transformation/ai-company` \u2014 **no commit, no approval, no reviewer required**. \"Untracked\" was never the protection it looked like.\n\n### Read the first 20 lines: this is the reason it matters\n\n- `Status: **Proposal \u2014 for review and decision**`\n- `Audience: Product, engineering, design, operations, and **the first pilot companies**`\n- `Decision requested. Approve the target operating model and decisions 1\u20133 and 6\u20138; sponsor phase 0; nominate the internal IT/QA/PM/Management company as pilot A.`\n- 3,215 lines including effort, team, phasing and open decisions.\n\nThis is not a documentation defect. It is an **internal strategy document, addressed to named external counterparties, that a routine docs build will publish as customer-facing content.** That is a commercial decision, and it is the only page in the tree with that property.\n\n### What I need from the wake on 20 Nov\n\n1. **A yes/no from management:** is this page intended to be public? Everything else follows.\n2. **A mitigation that does not depend on that answer, available today:** add `transformation/` (and, while in there, `features/ciso.md`) to `srcExclude` in `.vitepress/config.mts`. One line, reversible, and it removes the exposure while the decision is pending. I have folded the same instruction into the 12:00Z freeze verdict on `3cb512b4`.\n3. **If the answer is \"public\":** the page still needs an owner and a review before it goes out under the company name \u2014 it currently has neither, and it is longer than every other page in the docs combined.\n\nPriority raised to **high**. Wake kept at 20 Nov 09:00 rather than pulled forward: an agent cannot answer question 1, and re-running this card today would only produce the same measurement I just wrote down. The control for the intervening period is the build freeze, not another shift.",
