file does **not** move the `a8be6182` baseline |\\n\\n## The risk, stated precisely\\n\\nSame class as `07006e18` (two internal P0 review pages compiled into the site) but larger and less visible:\\n\\n- Unlinked and un-sitemapped \\u21d2 **not discoverable by browsing**, only by guessing the URL. So this is **publish-on-next-deploy + URL-guessable**, not \\\"already live\\\". Do not describe it as live: `fetch_webpage` on `docs.codx-junior.ai` and `codx-junior.ai` returned 404 for the sibling pages, there is no `.vitepress/dist/` in the tree, and `docker-compose.yaml` only runs `docs:dev` on port 19000 \\u2014 **there is no deploy target configured in this repository**.\\n- `ignoreDeadLinks: true` (`.vitepress/config.mts:10`) plus the absence of `srcExclude` means **no gate on this board can see this**. The CISO `allow` on `features/` is correct and irrelevant: it looks for secrets, not for whether a document was meant to be public.\\n- 3215 lines is not a docs page, it is a strategy document. Its presence under the published root is most likely an accident of where it was written.\\n\\n## What to do (one increment)\\n\\n1. **Establish provenance** with evidence, not assumption: `git log --follow -- transformation/ai-company.md` (expected empty \\u2014 untracked) and identify which task/author produced it. If it cannot be attributed, say so.\\n2. **Decide the destination \\u2014 that is the deliverable.** Exactly one of:\\n   - **(A) public**: move it to a deliberate location, add it to the sidebar, and remove the internal-only sections (hiring, comp, OKR) or mark them explicitly;\\n   - **(B) private**: keep it out of the site \\u2014 either move it outside the docs root or add its exact path to `srcExclude`;\\n   - **(C) delete**: if it is a duplicate of an existing strategy doc.\\n3. **Do not fold this into the diff under approval.** `a8be6182` is frozen at 12:00Z by `3cb512b4`; adding a file or a config key now invalidates the baseline for the third time. Land the change **after** the decision, on its own.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- Provenance recorded per file, quoted from a command, not inferred.\\n- One of A/B/C chosen and written here ",
          "output": "### Task ``transformation/ai-company.md` \u2014 3215 untracked lines of internal strategy material will compile into the public docs site; decide public/private before the next deploy`\n- ID: `721dc223-74b7-4319-b08d-0b4116d18fb7`\n- Status: `todo` | Mode: `chat`\n- Board: `IT team` | Column: `Scheduled`\n- Sprints: none\n- Priority: `high` | Progress: 0% | Due: `-` | Wake: `2026-11-20T09:00:00+00:00`\n- Assignees: biblio\n- Updated: 2026-11-19T11:15:12.711698\n- Description: ## What was measured (2026-11-19, shift 8)\n\nLogged as artefact #6 on intake card `2410a44c`, but it is outside that card's approval scope and nobody has decided what it is for, so it needs its own card.\n\n| Property | Measurement |\n|---|---|\n| Path | `transformation/ai-company.md` |\n| Git state | **untracked**, 3215 lines |\n| Where it lives | under the VitePress source root (this project root **is** `docs/`) |\n| Sidebar / nav | **absent** \u2014 not referenced in `.vitepress/config.mts` |\n| `srcExclude` | **does not exist in the config** \u2192 every `.md` under the root is compiled |\n| Content | internal authority matrix, hiring plan, OKR/strategy material (\"From a multi-AI workspace to an AI company\") |\n| Inside the pending approval diff? | **No** \u2014 the diff filter is `delivery-contract.md, features, qa, .vitepress, .codx/.gitignore`; `transformation/` is outside it, so this file does **not** move the `a8be6182` baseline |\n\n## The risk, stated precisely\n\nSame class as `07006e18` (two internal P0 review pages compiled into the site) but larger and less visible:\n\n- Unlinked and un-sitemapped \u21d2 **not discoverable by browsing**, only by guessing the URL. So this is **publish-on-next-deploy + URL-guessable**, not \"already live\". Do not describe it as live: `fetch_webpage` on `docs.codx-junior.ai` and `codx-junior.ai` returned 404 for the sibling pages, there is no `.vitepress/dist/` in the tree, and `docker-compose.yaml` only runs `docs:dev` on port 19000 \u2014 **there is no deploy target configured in this repository**.\n- `ignoreDeadLinks: true` (`.vitepress/config.mts:10`) plus the absence of `srcExclude` means **no gate on this board can see this**. The CISO `allow` on `features/` is correct and irrelevant: it looks for secrets, not for whether a document was meant to be public.\n- 3215 lines is not a docs page, it is a strategy document. Its presence under the published root is most likely an accident of where it was written.\n\n## What to do (one increment)\n\n1. **Establish provenance** with evidence, not assumption: `git log --follow -- transformation/ai-company.md` (expected empty \u2014 untracked) and identify which task/author produced it. If it cannot be attributed, say so.\n2. **Decide the destination \u2014 that is the deliverable.** Exactly one of:\n   - **(A) public**: move it to a deliberate location, add it to the sidebar, and remove the internal-only sections (hiring, comp, OKR) or mark them explicitly;\n   - **(B) private**: keep it out of the site \u2014 either move it outside the docs root or add its exact path to `srcExclude`;\n   - **(C) delete**: if it is a duplicate of an existing strategy doc.\n3. **Do not fold this into the diff under approval.** `a8be6182` is frozen at 12:00Z by `3cb512b4`; adding a file or a config key now invalidates the baseline for the third time. Land the change **after** the decision, on its own.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Provenance recorded per file, quoted from a command, not inferred.\n- One of A/B/C chosen and written here with the reason.\n- If (B) via `srcExclude`: **list the exact path**, never a glob such as `transformation/*` \u2014 a glob would silently exclude future pages someone wants published (`07006e18` carries the same constraint).\n- Post-change evidence is an **artifact check, not a green build**: not `npm run docs:build` exiting 0 (meaningless while `ignoreDeadLinks: true`), but e.g. `ls .vitepress/dist/transformation/ 2>/dev/null | grep -c ai-company` \u2192 `0` for (B).\n- No unrelated file modified.\n\n## Relationships\n\n- Sibling: `07006e18` (the two `features/workspaces-*-review` pages, same root cause).\n- Blocked by nothing; blocked on a human decision for A vs B vs C.\n- Reference: `54658755` (`ignoreDeadLinks: true` makes the build gate unable to fail).\n\n**Conversation**\n> Last 2 of 2 visible message(s)\n- **user**: ## What was measured (2026-11-19, shift 8)  Logged as artefact #6 on intake card `2410a44c`, but it is outside that card's approval scope and nobody has decided what it is for, so it needs its own card.  | Property | Measurement | |---|---| | Path | `transformation/ai-company.md` | | Git state | **u...\n- **assistant**: ## 11:13Z \u2014 raising to high: the file is not \"untracked\", it is **publishable now**, and the exposure is commercial  This card wakes on 20 Nov. The exposure does not wait for the wake, so the facts belong here as evidence, and the mitigation is a one-line change that can be made today.  ### Confirme...",
